      "adPath": "/politics/elections",
      "primarySectionID": "/elections",
      "position": {
        "large": "incontent_1"
      }
    },
    {
      "arcId": "6I7MAPEBMVBUZASKACTPL6S2RY",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "paragraph",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": "Doeden’s success in the June primary over high-profile officeholders defied early expectations.<b> </b>Rep. Dusty Johnson (R), the state’s sole House member since 2019, led in fundraising and polling in the early months of the race, but finished third. State House Speaker Jon Hansen also ran."
    },
    {
      "arcId": "NHFYSOVQOJGI5FD6ZOEXXDCU2A",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "paragraph",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "content": "Doeden was boosted in the runoff with spending by Pennsylvania billionaire Jeff Yass and a super PAC affiliated with conservative small-government group Club for Growth."
    },
    {
      "arcId": "AVDHRTTJI5FRVNN4WP5HKGO5AM",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "paragraph",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "content": "The Democratic gubernatorial nominee is former state legislator Dan Ahlers. South Dakota has not had a Democratic governor since the late 1970s."
    },
